The pens the graph asks for, as the strokes draw them:

```dot
digraph {
  rankdir=LR;
  parse [color="#7aa2f7", fontcolor="#7aa2f7"];
  grid [fillcolor="#9ece6a", style=filled];
  paint [color="#e0af68", fontcolor="#e0af68"];
  glass;
  parse -> grid [color="#f7768e"];
  grid -> paint [color="#bb9af7", fontcolor="#bb9af7", label="scale"];
  paint -> glass;
}
